    {
      "id": "deposit-runs-stale-v1-and-inflates-lp",
      "question": "What did the deposit that took 99.9% of the LBTC-SUI vault's LP run, and what did it change?",
      "tool": "analyze_attack_tx",
      "args": {
        "digest": "{inflating_deposit_tx}"
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "path": "profit.address",
          "op": "iequals",
          "value": "{attacker_a}"
        },
        {
          "path": "anomalies[*].code",
          "op": "includes",
          "value": "stale-package-version"
        },
        {
          "path": "anomalies[*].code",
          "op": "includes",
          "value": "shared-state-jump"
        },
        {
          "path": "state_deltas.jumps[*].field",
          "op": "includes",
          "value": "last_aum"
        },
        {
          "path": "state_deltas.jumps[*].field",
          "op": "includes",
          "value": "lp_token_treasury.total_supply.value"
        },
        {
          "path": "_text",
          "op": "contains",
          "value": "{vault_v1}::vault::deposit"
        },
        {
          "path": "_text",
          "op": "contains",
          "value": "v3 {vault_v3} was already published"
        }
      ],
      "tier": "chain-derived",
      "basis": "Chain: the transaction calls v1 calculate_aum and deposit while v3 (2025-12-23) was the newest version; the LBTC-SUI vault's LP supply went from 25,865,437,586,547 to 26,876,536,092,401,957 for 577,605 DEEP and 0.62 USDC. Haedal: excess LP was minted through an old deposit path."
    },
    {
